  "description": "The network comparison. Needletail: a contributor in London, two backbone relays, and in each of London, New York, Tokyo and Sydney two distributors and two edges on a private VLAN, all Nanodes. LiveKit: one Nanode in each of the four regions (a single SFU, and a member of the multi-region set that shares the Redis of lk-redis). Viewers, the same for every system: in each region one Nanode for the probes and one host with four dedicated vCPUs for headless Chrome, which a Nanode cannot run at 4K. lon-src sends the same clip into every system. Sydney has no dedicated plan of four vCPUs, so syd-view is a shared plan of four vCPUs; its steal time is recorded.",
